# Cruelclaw's Heist cast without promising the gift: nothing is drawn by Bot2 (its hand is the Bolt and six Islands, so six
# cards after the Bolt goes), the Bolt is exiled and Bot1 gets no permission to cast it: with a Mox Pearl untapped,
# Bot1 is refused the Bolt from exile (its positive control is the scenario where the gift is promised).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Cruelclaw's Heist
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cruelclaw's Heist.Cast
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Exile = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Cruelclaw's Heist
